{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米在陶匠的家"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話臨到耶利米說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你起來，下到窯匠的家裏去，我在那裏要使你聽我的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我就下到窯匠的家裏去，正遇他轉輪做器皿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["窯匠用泥做的器皿，在他手中做壞了，他又用這泥另做別的器皿；窯匠看怎樣好，就怎樣做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華的話就臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「耶和華說：以色列家啊，我待你們，豈不能照這窯匠弄泥嗎？以色列家啊，泥在窯匠的手中怎樣，你們在我的手中也怎樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我何時論到一邦或一國說，要拔出、拆毀、毀壞；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我所說的那一邦，若是轉意離開他們的惡，我就必後悔，不將我想要施行的災禍降與他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我何時論到一邦或一國說，要建立、栽植；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們若行我眼中看為惡的事，不聽從我的話，我就必後悔，不將我所說的福氣賜給他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["現在你要對猶大人和耶路撒冷的居民說：『耶和華如此說：我造出災禍攻擊你們，定意刑罰你們。你們各人當回頭離開所行的惡道，改正你們的行動作為。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「他們卻說：『這是枉然。我們要照自己的計謀去行。』各人隨自己頑梗的惡心做事。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["百姓忘記耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以，耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們且往各國訪問，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有誰聽見這樣的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列民","poem":1},{"noteId":22},{"text":"行了一件極可憎惡的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的雪從田野的磐石上豈能斷絕呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遠處流下的涼水豈能乾涸呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓竟忘記我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向假神燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們在所行的路上，在古道上絆跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們行沒有修築的斜路，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們的地令人驚駭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"常常嗤笑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡經過這地的必驚駭搖頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在仇敵面前分散他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像用東風吹散一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭難的日子，我必以背向他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不以面向他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["謀害耶利米"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他們就說：「來吧！我們可以設計謀害耶利米；因為我們有祭司講律法，智慧人設謀略，先知說預言，都不能斷絕。來吧！我們可以用舌頭擊打他，不要理會他的一切話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你理會我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且聽那些與我爭競之人的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈可以惡報善呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們竟挖坑要害我的性命！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你記念我怎樣站在你面前為他們代求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使你的忿怒向他們轉消。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，願你將他們的兒女交與饑荒和刀劍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們的妻無子，且作寡婦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又願他們的男人被死亡所滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的少年人在陣上被刀擊殺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使敵軍忽然臨到他們的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願人聽見哀聲從他們的屋內發出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們挖坑要捉拿我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暗設網羅要絆我的腳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，他們要殺我的那一切計謀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你都知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要赦免他們的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要從你面前塗抹他們的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要叫他們在你面前跌倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你發怒的時候罰辦他們。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":22,"caller":"-","text":"原文是處女","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}